<title>UK: UK's Clarke says on course on borrowing forecasts.</title>
<headline>UK's Clarke says on course on borrowing forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke said in a statement he was well on course to hit his forecast made in the Summer of a 26.9 billion stg borrowing requirement for 1996-7.  </p>
<p>DATA RELEASED TODAY SHOWED</p>
<p>==========================</p>
<p>UK OCTOBER PSDR 4.393 BLN STG, PRIVATISATION RECEIPTS 222 MLN STG</p>
<p>UK OCTOBER CUMULATIVE PSBR 11.355 BLN STG VS 18.719 BLN STG IN OCTOBER</p>
</text>
